 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A7 02}那座时钟塔里面确实够呛。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}而且，还有“收割者”……\n连那种东西都开始四处游荡了……\n真让人受不了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E7 02}那倒是很可靠，不过别累垮了啊？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}毕竟连那个……\n“收割者”都在。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}那个……真是出乎意料。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 13 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 92 0D}对不起……\n记忆苏醒的时候，\n我就该想到这一点。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A3 05}现在说后悔话有什么用啊。\n你专心想着救玲就行了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0A 01 0D 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 78 11}哎呀，完二真是完美的男子汉！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}完二说得对。\n现在不是说那些的时候。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我们要做什么，早就决定好了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 7B 0B}就是沿着外墙攀爬的作战吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 0D 01 04 01 04 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 02}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}我觉得只有埃癸斯\n才能做到吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 23 04}不过，时钟塔里确实\n比之前更消耗体力呢……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 11 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 07}小熊恨不得现在就冲过去\n救出小玲熊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:13:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0F 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 00 06}可是，恋爱有时也讲究进退熊。\n要谨慎又大胆地进攻！\n就是这样熊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0B 01 04 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 68 0B}谨慎又大胆……\n原来如此，那就爬时钟塔外墙……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 11 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 26 03}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}做不到啦！\n能爬到三楼就不错了吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0B 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 64 06}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}咦……你真的打算爬吗！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 9E 05}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}那我就爬到五楼，\n让你们看看什么叫男子汉！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0D 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 81 07}那小熊就华丽地跳到你背上！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E5 04}你根本不打算自己爬啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}爬，当然爬。\n不过得老老实实从里面爬。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:20:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}不管多大，总有楼梯。\n早晚都能走到顶。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:20:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 BA 02}既然如此，就只能前进了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 76 11}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}咦，不爬墙了吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0B 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2A 03}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}笨蛋，只是打个比方。\n我是说，要拿出爬外墙的毅力，\n一路冲到顶。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5C 06}呵呵……说得对。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:24:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0232",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}要是真的太艰难，\n再考虑从外面攀爬的办法吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
