  "message_id": "MSG_0232",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}请记得随时留有余地，\n以便调整作战方案。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:25:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}我知道{F5 47 02 01 02 01 03 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:25:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}没什么信心……{F5 47 02 01 02 01 07 01 01 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:26:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_025",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 F7 04}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}真不愧是学长，好可靠！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:27:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_026",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 EC 04}不——行。\n队长要是不能从容应对，\n大家也会跟着着急哦？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:28:0",
