  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 10 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 7B 0B}各位都斗志昂扬呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_210.bf.json:28:1",
